            "date": "2020-07-27T16:44:11Z"
          },
          "message": "fix(transport): Return connection error on `Channel::connect` (#413)\n\nBefore this fix, if the connect phase of the transport failed before\r\never establishing a connection, we would never return the error until\r\nthe first call to send a request. This PR changes that behavior to only\r\nforward the error to the call method if we have ever made a connection\r\nbefore. If we have never established a connection before then\r\n`Reconnect` will return an error on the call to `poll_ready`.\r\n\r\nFixes #403",
          "tree": {
            "sha": "23dd50be521a40cf002dae4baf81abbea3011fa0",
            "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/tonic/git/trees/23dd50be521a40cf002dae4baf81abbea3011fa0"
          },
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/tonic/git/commits/2ea17b2ecfc40a20f4d9608f807b3d099a8f415d",
          "comment_count": 0,
          "verification": {
            "verified": true,
            "reason": "valid",
            "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJfHwRbCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAdHIIADtXNFH1wpHjVbuReO2XzOpf\n68Ofs8Aw1d6y/ag6TJBzf1N/uumDURtgbFauodkatK2CfBJu5uOmVhTZCvOheemD\nFWgjYxTwkWG9Rp/cE5UDVaBpviXqypdbSF9fd0d9DEA0Ial0oioOIIXYfJRbYHwN\nJnrHmir5gaAOzK1SCrrumLdI+ny9KWj/SaSej3Ckv6jgIqgVapOHu7IRUzGETI/y\npzi2UctDHZ2pMN6eESM996UTTeZh6APUKmymx8W9taLsRxJeY1lztB5oLC6B1Au6\nGnxQ180/LDpFL66500Xn7p1U5StJSI0RLj9asIFS/gJbUjsr1TTzTOX4yH/fSPo=\n=8xvw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
            "payload": "tree 23dd50be521a40cf002dae4baf81abbea3011fa0\nparent 5bd8a04baff0b39b543d9d7724af6ccc95b50253\nauthor Lucio Franco <luciofranco14@gmail.com> 1595868251 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1595868251 -0400\n\nfix(transport): Return connection error on `Channel::connect` (#413)\n\nBefore this fix, if the connect phase of the transport failed before\r\never establishing a connection, we would never return the error until\r\nthe first call to send a request. This PR changes that behavior to only\r\nforward the error to the call method if we have ever made a connection\r\nbefore. If we have never established a connection before then\r\n`Reconnect` will return an error on the call to `poll_ready`.\r\n\r\nFixes #403"
          }
        },
